  "unknowns": [
    "Episodes are not mapped to podcasts in the brief; every podcast shows the same eight episodes.",
    "Only three podcasts have a description; the others show title and author only.",
    "No 40-character podcast title exists in the content; the long-title card uses an episode title as a stress test.",
    "Search placeholder text 'Search podcasts' is not in the brief.",
    "Badge color: spec default (error) kept although a subscription count is not an error.",
    "Fixed color roles (primaryFixed etc.) exist in the generator output but are not in the allowed role list, so they are excluded.",
    "PNGs are captures of the live board (compact at 4x, others at 2x), light scheme except HomeScreen.dark."
  ]
}